# RR2c-2a (critical_qualifier_receivers_bug; steps/qualifier-receivers-20261010.md): `const` over the merge protects
# the binding (docs #qualification: "it cannot be assigned, rebound or replaced"): the later `a: b` is refused at the
# statement, before the arity reading a head holding a Structure gets (Q59).
Integer:
    int: value 0
end: Integer
fn: m () int
    a: const: merge(Integer  int: value 7)
    b: merge(Integer  int: value 8)
    a: b
    return: a\value
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
